      "message": "feat(post): add RichAuto DSP A11 3-axis router post\n\nAdd assets/posts/richauto.cps and register it as \"RichAuto DSP A11\".\nThe output follows the .mmg program that a Laguna Swift A11 runs (#1907):\nN10 step-10 sequence numbers, no spaces between words, three decimals,\nG00/G1, M03S<rpm>, modal words left out, and a final % line.\n\nThe post writes G21G90G17 and no G54 (the pendant work origin). It keeps\none tool per program, expands drilling to plain moves, writes incremental\nI/J/K arcs, and refuses tapping, G41/G42, probing, rotary moves, a second\ntool and other work offsets by name.\n\nPinned by script_richauto (41 tests) and the conformance matrix.\n\nFixes #1914\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
